<title>CHINA: Shanghai Haixin 96 net up 53.81 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Haixin 96 net up 53.81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	 594.781	  vs     438.311</p>
<p> Net profit	75.139	  vs	48.851</p>
<p> Asset per share     2.78 yuan    vs   3.02 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share  0.45 yuan    vs   0.38 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Haixin Group Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results are from a company statement issued on Thursday. The net profit numbers are based on international accounting standards, other figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>According to domestic accounting standards, the company posted a 1996 net profit of 75.90 million yuan, against a net profit of 54.142 million yuan in 1995.</p>
</text>
